      <title>Democrats Shouldn’t Get Too Excited About Those Independent Candidates</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-01/democrats-shouldn-t-get-too-excited-about-those-independent-candidates</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4c5d58795d9650ee89f6d219</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>The closer we get to the end of the midterms, the more polls seem to show that Republicans won’t just lose, but lose in a rout. Some of the latest have Democrats winning as many as 240 seats in the House and easily retaking control of the Senate. Indeed, Democrats believe this is their year.</description>
